NOTE ON BUNDLED DATA

data/ contains tables derived from Galaxy Zoo: Mergers (Holincheck et al. 2016,
MNRAS 459, 720) and image cutouts from the SDSS DR18 SkyServer. These remain the
property of their respective surveys and are redistributed for research and
educational use under their own terms, not under the MIT licence above. Cite the
Holincheck paper for any use of the fitted parameters, and follow SDSS's
acknowledgement guidance for the imagery.
